<title>USA: TENNIS-ATP CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ATP CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MASON, Ohio 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the $2.3</p>
<p>million ATP Championships on Tuesday (prefix number denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>4-Alex Corretja (Spain) beat Jonathan Stark (U.S.) 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Vince Spadea (U.S.) beat 8-Thomas Enqvist (Sweden) 6-7 (1-7)</p>
<p>6-3 6-3</p>
<p>Jan Siemerink (Netherlands) beat 13-Petr Korda (Czech</p>
<p>Republic) 7-5 1-6 6-1</p>
<p>Andrei Medvedev (Ukraine) beat Mark Woodforde (Australia) 6-4</p>
<p>1-6 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>10-Gustavo Kuerten (Brazil) beat Andre Agassi (U.S.) 6-3 6-1</p>
<p>Sjeng Schalken (Netherlands) beat 11-Mark Philippoussis</p>
<p>(Australia) 7-6 (7-5) 6-3  </p>
<p>14-Albert Costa (Spain) beat Jim Courier (U.S.) 4-6 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Justin Gimelstob (U.S.) beat Byron Black (Zimbabwe) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Chris Woodruff (U.S.) beat Sargis Sargsian (Armenia) 6-2 6-4</p>
<p>Daniel Nestor (Canada) beat Alex O'Brien (U.S.) 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>Fabrice Santoro (France) beat Patrick McEnroe (U.S.) 6-0 6-4</p>
<p>Wayne Ferreira (South Africa) beat Arnaud Boetsch (France)</p>
<p>6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Scott Draper (Australia) beat Richey Reneberg (U.S.) 1-6 7-6</p>
<p>(7-3) 6-4</p>
<p>Thomas Johansson (Sweden) beat Kevin Ullyett (South Africa)</p>
<p>6-4 3-6 6-2</p>
</text>
